Make a web app that:
    - section finder
        - you do the see thing so you get all the headers
        - so that you can search important headers/sections for key word
    - crop pdf
        - you upload a pdf
        - you can then see the pdf and select the starting pages and pages to exclude
        - from there you can crop the pdf and download a new .pdf
    - extract text from pdf
        - ask the user for specific information - text size, color, etc that matches the key section
        - the app will then scan the text and return the data of that information, denoted by which pages they came from
        - could also ask the user for information about what the page number looks like
    - analyze pdf
        - output a list of the most frequent stylizations in the pdf and some example texts for each style
        - that way the user can easily see which sections have which stylizations
    - export
        - take all of this data and put it in the format appropriate for AI infra team